Subject: [PATCH 158/202] Meridian: Boost editor, Zap and colour pad as Arc's

The editor is a card at the right of the page: a colour pad with a rim of
hues and two knobs (the colour, and the page's dark in it), dark or light,
brightness/contrast/saturation, a font grid (Mac or Windows fonts), size,
case, Zap, code, Improve with AI. The site's boosts are listed in the site
controls. Zap offers Zap This or all related elements, and an Undo per zap
that shows what it brings back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
